{"context": "published", "host": "www.josephsmithpapers.org", "showHeader": true, "footerStyle": "mini", "statusCode": 200, "uri": "letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839", "page": "3", "is404": false, "gallery": [{"image": "/433/433_brbl_001_thumb.jpg", "page": "1", "label": "[1]", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839/1"}, {"image": "/433/433_brbl_002_thumb.jpg", "page": "2", "label": "[2]", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839/2"}, {"image": "/433/433_brbl_003_thumb.jpg", "page": "3", "label": "[3]", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839/3"}, {"image": "/433/433_brbl_003-01_thumb.jpg", "page": "4", "label": "[4]", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839/4"}], "tableOfContents": [], "summary": {"uri": "letter-to-emma-smith-4-april-1839", "series": "JSPPD", "urlTitleValue": "JSPPD6", "documentSeriesTitle": "Letter to Emma Smith, 4 April 1839", "editorialPageNumber": "3", "isPageNumberPresent": false, "searchUrl": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/30488226/30488226-0003.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"><span class=\"josephswriting\"> the need of my council, and help, but </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">a</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> combin</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">nation </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">of</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> things have conspired to place me where </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">I am, and I know it </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">is</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> not my fault, and further </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">if my voice and </span><span class=\"underscore\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">council</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">, had been heeded I shou</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">ld not have been here, but I find no fault </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">with you, att all I know nothing but what </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">you have done the best you could, if there is </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">any thing it is known to yourself, you must </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">be your own judge, on that subject: and </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">if ether of </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> us have done wrong it is </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">wise in us to repent of it, and for God </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">sake, do not b</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">e</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> so foolish as to yield to </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">the flattery of the Devel, faslshoods, and </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">vainty, in this hour of trouble, that our </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">affections be drawn, away from the right </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">objects, those preasious things, God has given </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">us will rise up in judgement against us </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> if we </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">do not mark well our steps, and ways. </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">My heart has often been exceeding sorrow</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">ful when I have thought of these thing</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">s</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">for many considerations, one thing let </span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">me</span>]<span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">adm</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">onish</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> you by way of my duty, do not </span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">be</span>]<span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">self willed, neither harber a spirit of re</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">vevenge: and again remember that he </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">who is my enemy</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">, </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">is yours also, and nev</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">er give up an old tried friend, who has </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">waded through all manner of toil, for </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">your sake, and throw him away becaus fools may tell </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">you</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> he </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">has</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> some </span><span class=\"underscore\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">faults</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">; these things </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">have accured to </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">me</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> as I have been writing, I do </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">speak of </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">them</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> because you do not know them, but </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">because I want to stir up your pure mind </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">by way of </span><span class=\"underscore\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">rememberance</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">: all feelings of diss</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">at</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">isfaction is far from my heart, I wish to act </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">upon that principle of </span><span class=\"underscore\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">generosity</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">, that will acquit </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">myself in the preasance of </span>[<span class=\"italic note-data editorial-comment\" isnote=\"Y\">page cut</span>]<span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">through the mercy of God You</span><span class=\"josephswriting\">rs</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"josephswriting\">Joseph Smith Jr.</span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span> [p. [3]]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"><span class=\"josephswriting\"> the need of my council, and help, but </span><span class=\"deleted\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">as</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span>&lt;​<span class=\"josephswriting\">a</span>​&gt;<span class=\"josephswriting\"> combin</span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">nation </span>&lt;​<span class=\"josephswriting\">of</span>​&gt;<span class=\"josephswriting\"> things have conspired to place me where </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">I am, and I know it </span>&lt;​<span class=\"josephswriting\">is</span>​&gt;<span class=\"josephswriting\"> not my fault, and further </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">if my voice and </span><span class=\"underscore\"><span class=\"josephswriting\">council</span></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">, had been heeded I shou</span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">ld not have been here, but I find no fault </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">with you, att all I know nothing but what </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">you have done the best you could, if there is </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">any thing it is known to yourself, you must </span><span class=\"line-break\"